00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:06.293
Oh yeah.

00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:10.273
- Oh,

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:13.845
- [Andrew] Such a luscious meatball.

00:03:13.845 --> 00:03:14.678
I don't know what is better in this bowl,

00:03:15.331 --> 00:03:16.520
