00:03:24.520 --> 00:03:26.130
and a belly and then we roast it.

00:03:26.130 --> 00:03:27.210
^- Oh man,
- mmm.

00:03:28.594 --> 00:03:30.024
^- Here's the porchetta.

00:03:30.024 --> 00:03:30.857
^- Oh, oh.

00:03:34.517 --> 00:03:39.010
- How could we resist, I can't believe you can also get this

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:40.860
at a place where you get a $14 bowl

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:42.210
of spaghetti and meatballs.

00:03:43.715 --> 00:03:44.548
^Oh.

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:49.883
- Long spaghetti, fresh pasta, meatballs, classic.

00:03:50.320 --> 00:03:51.883
