00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:16.360
Doesn't that kind of look like that?

00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:17.193
Cheers.

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:21.963
Oh man.

00:06:21.963 --> 00:06:22.796
- Wow.

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:23.693
- Hell yeah.

00:06:23.693 --> 00:06:24.526
- Whoa.

00:06:24.526 --> 00:06:26.070
I was not expecting that at all.

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:26.903
- No,

00:06:26.903 --> 00:06:27.736
- What?

00:06:27.736 --> 00:06:28.860
You look at this and you're like, okay I'm about to eat

